<title>UK: Rugby Estates in 8.4 million stg London buy.</title>
<headline>Rugby Estates in 8.4 million stg London buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property company Rugby Estates Plc has acquired a major estate in London's Covent Garden for 8.4 million stg. The estate is a 40,000 square feet freehold mixed use block of property on the corner of The Strand in central London.</p>
<p>The deal, Rugby's largest single acquisition to date, is part of the company's strategy of building up its portfolio in growth areas of the capital. It is being financed from existing cash resources and additional loan facilites.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
